<rss version="2.0"><channel><title>IndieHOT 独立游戏热点</title><link>https://staroltest.github.io/indie-game-hot/</link><description>IndieHOT 每天从一批独立游戏信源里收动态，按规则打分精选：引擎与工具、发行与宣发、开发日志、行业与融资、展会与活动、评测与复盘。只显示标题、一句自己写简介与原文链接，不转载全文。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 21:05:59 GMT</lastBuildDate><item><title>如何为你的第一款电子游戏做 Playtest</title><link>https://unity.com/blog/how-to-playtest-your-first-video-game</link><description>Unity 官方的新手指南，讲清什么是 Playtest、为什么重要，以及如何组织一次测试并把反馈落到用 AI 辅助开发的流程里。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">3486df46b65296899f6e959e160582d7b06a8a4a</guid><source url="https://unity.com/blog/how-to-playtest-your-first-video-game">Unity 博客</source></item><item><title>用 Unreal Engine 把 Anyma 的 Coachella 演出扩展为广播 AR</title><link>https://www.unrealengine.com/spotlights/expanding-anymas-coachella-performance-into-broadcast-ar-with-unreal-engine</link><description>Anyma 的 Coachella 现场借助 Unreal Engine、MetaHuman 与广播 AR 技术，把音乐视觉体验带给了线上观众。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">337da5318251a6bfe1b582440f1fa57277a240c1</guid><source url="https://www.unrealengine.com/spotlights/expanding-anymas-coachella-performance-into-broadcast-ar-with-unreal-engine">Unreal Engine 博客</source></item><item><title>10月中国游戏市场收入300亿元同比减少4.27%：手游下滑2.2%，PC下滑15%</title><link>http://www.gamelook.com.cn/2026/11/606588</link><description>伽马数据报告显示 10 月中国游戏市场实际销售收入 300 亿元、同比下降 4.27%，其中手游下滑 2.2%、PC 端下滑 15%。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 01:20:49 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">bbca242b56331ed890aaaf6f593b6c33b511d943</guid><source url="http://www.gamelook.com.cn/2026/11/606588">GameLook</source></item><item><title>游戏配音总听着“不对劲”——问题不在演员身上</title><link>https://dev.to/nan_nan_d86f644d31091c00f/why-your-game-vo-always-sounds-off-and-its-not-the-actors-3nfn</link><description>配音忽大忽小多半不是录音问题，而是各条音频没统一到同一响度标准，文章给出 LUFS 与真峰值的对齐办法。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 12:41:46 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">72b3444ab36c5a58e61c6661787f8b106f0266fd</guid><source url="https://dev.to/nan_nan_d86f644d31091c00f/why-your-game-vo-always-sounds-off-and-its-not-the-actors-3nfn">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>Unity XR 开发中的 AI 智能体：从写代码到测试 VR 工作流</title><link>https://dev.to/divyesh_makawana/-ai-agents-in-unity-xr-development-from-writing-code-to-testing-vr-workflows-og</link><description>作者以 Meta Quest 3 开发者视角，聊 AI 工具如何从代码提示走向与开发工具联动的工作流，这对调试环节繁杂的 XR 开发尤其有价值。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 14:10:01 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">a62502b4a0cc46e005de34d69aa8cb193b18945b</guid><source url="https://dev.to/divyesh_makawana/-ai-agents-in-unity-xr-development-from-writing-code-to-testing-vr-workflows-og">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>Godot 迎来新白金赞助商 Manus AI</title><link>https://gamefromscratch.com/godots-new-sponsor-manus-ai</link><description>Manus AI 成为 Godot 基金会的白金级赞助商，AI 公司赞助开源项目已不新鲜，但对社区来说仍是个值得关注的动向。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 15:23:09 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">d590a3b6f562375be10726f2092453dd0a654c4d</guid><source url="https://gamefromscratch.com/godots-new-sponsor-manus-ai">GameFromScratch</source></item><item><title>GTA 6 尚未发售已领跑 2026 年游戏大奖提名，获 8 项提名：工艺与开发要点</title><link>https://dev.to/trendzbetagames/gta-6-leads-the-game-awards-2026-nominees-with-8-nods-before-launch-key-craft-gamedev-takeaways-4i2e</link><description>《GTA 6》发售前就以 8 项提名领跑游戏大奖，文章梳理了它在工艺与开发层面值得独立开发者借鉴的地方。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 16:28:41 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">57fae1711af06f9ede1b8f70deea43c0f39c1d09</guid><source url="https://dev.to/trendzbetagames/gta-6-leads-the-game-awards-2026-nominees-with-8-nods-before-launch-key-craft-gamedev-takeaways-4i2e">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>跨两个时区的 Unreal Engine 项目怎么交接：给离岸团队的清单</title><link>https://dev.to/juegostudiosofficial/splitting-an-unreal-engine-project-across-two-time-zones-a-handoff-checklist-for-offshore-teams-4mf5</link><description>当团队分处班加罗尔与伦敦、奥斯汀，工作日重叠只有几小时，这份清单帮你把交接写进流程，避免第二天一上班就被卡住。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 17:43:27 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">76718ca8e95869a0ad430297202dcc6617e6cda7</guid><source url="https://dev.to/juegostudiosofficial/splitting-an-unreal-engine-project-across-two-time-zones-a-handoff-checklist-for-offshore-teams-4mf5">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>NVIDIA 扩展 RTX Spark 产品线：为开发者、创作者与 AI 爱好者推出紧凑型桌面主机</title><link>https://80.lv/articles/nvidia-expands-rtx-spark-lineup-with-compact-desktops-for-developers-creators-and-ai-enthusiasts</link><description>NVIDIA 联手华硕、戴尔与微星推出紧凑型 RTX Spark 桌面主机，最高 128GB 统一内存，面向 3D、视频与本地 AI 工作流。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 17:30:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">bbf081dc437161221fa8314fa06c0e94555e7695</guid><source url="https://80.lv/articles/nvidia-expands-rtx-spark-lineup-with-compact-desktops-for-developers-creators-and-ai-enthusiasts">80 Level</source></item><item><title>一只鸭子机器人，让我突然看懂了本地AI</title><link>https://www.yystv.cn/p/14649</link><description>在 NVIDIA 上海办公室看了一圈 RTX Spark 的本地模型演示后，作者意识到本地 AI 的价值不在替代云端大模型，而是让 AI 走进日常：游戏里的语音小助手就是一例。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 16:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">3bb92db16b4c43655711f6290207b94869ed9f46</guid><source url="https://www.yystv.cn/p/14649">游研社</source></item><item><title>用 6 行 JS 屏幕震动加顿帧技巧，立刻给游戏加上“打击感”</title><link>https://dev.to/goutam_lambu_0a07d682a4ee/add-instant-game-feel-with-this-6-line-js-screen-shake-hit-stop-trick-1ifm</link><description>不用物理引擎，六行代码就能在渲染循环里实现屏幕震动与顿帧，让 2D 网页小游戏瞬间有了街机般的手感。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 19:00:23 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">5d5b80ea84e34c545b57d2eb3458101b7af294fb</guid><source url="https://dev.to/goutam_lambu_0a07d682a4ee/add-instant-game-feel-with-this-6-line-js-screen-shake-hit-stop-trick-1ifm">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>拐点已至：移动游戏为何正成为数字广告组合中不可或缺的一环</title><link>https://unity.com/blog/the-inflection-point-why-mobile-gaming-is-becoming-essential-to-the-digital-advertising-mix</link><description>受众规模与广告支出的差距正在缩小，Unity 拆解了更精准的衡量与定向能力如何让手游成为广告主绕不开的投放渠道。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">cbb8a7ca77625014788f46d498e1fba5937d75db</guid><source url="https://unity.com/blog/the-inflection-point-why-mobile-gaming-is-becoming-essential-to-the-digital-advertising-mix">Unity 博客</source></item><item><title>开发快照：Godot 4.8 beta 4</title><link>https://godotengine.org/article/dev-snapshot-godot-4-8-beta-4</link><description>Godot 4.8 进入收尾阶段，beta 4 修复了大部分剩余发布阻塞问题，可能是本轮最后一个 beta 快照。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 12:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">e632f3e18a6ed1cbef0491ce4edf05f4e60dd1bb</guid><source url="https://godotengine.org/article/dev-snapshot-godot-4-8-beta-4">Godot 引擎博客</source></item><item><title>一套 TypeScript 代码，两个引擎：用 Claude Opus 为 Epic AI MegaJam 打造《Hook Horizon》</title><link>https://dev.to/spacedevin/one-typescript-codebase-two-engines-building-hook-horizon-with-claude-opus-for-the-epic-ai-megajam-3glf</link><description>开发者用四天时间以同一套 TypeScript 代码，让钓鱼线平台跳跃游戏同时跑在浏览器与 Unreal Engine 5.8 上，全程借助 Claude Opus 完成。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 20:31:45 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">8358d12e8db4257b1fc175ab86f6eadb7428c8d4</guid><source url="https://dev.to/spacedevin/one-typescript-codebase-two-engines-building-hook-horizon-with-claude-opus-for-the-epic-ai-megajam-3glf">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>我如何为几款经典 PC 游戏写了非官方原生 64 位 Linux/ARM64 SDL2 引擎</title><link>https://dev.to/aionedge/how-i-built-unofficial-native-64-bit-linuxarm64-sdl2-engines-for-a-few-classic-pc-games-2694</link><description>作者分享自己为几款老游戏手写原生 64 位 Linux 与 ARM64 引擎的技术笔记，让它们摆脱 Wine 与旧 32 位环境的束缚。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 21:18:39 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">09abe47809036a41c1a8ea64ad61adc3ddca23e8</guid><source url="https://dev.to/aionedge/how-i-built-unofficial-native-64-bit-linuxarm64-sdl2-engines-for-a-few-classic-pc-games-2694">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>Spine 对比 Exode：游戏骨骼动画与界面骨骼动画之争</title><link>https://dev.to/shinoj_cm_6b559b3ab51bf47/spine-vs-exode-skeletal-animation-for-games-vs-skeletal-animation-for-interfaces-4oab</link><description>Spine 是游戏 2D 骨骼动画十余年的默认选择，Exode 近一年补齐了骨骼、IK 与权重绘制，两者功能表面重叠，实则面向不同的产物，选错会浪费数月，文章具体划清了各自的适用边界。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 22:24:37 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">67deaa1a246e0e0931d393934ba4868c6845acde</guid><source url="https://dev.to/shinoj_cm_6b559b3ab51bf47/spine-vs-exode-skeletal-animation-for-games-vs-skeletal-animation-for-interfaces-4oab">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>gta4-reversed：用 C++20 运行时重实现 GTA IV，进度突破 1%</title><link>https://dev.to/master4824/gta4-reversed-starting-a-c20-runtime-reimplementation-of-gta-iv-1070-crossing-1-e5</link><description>这个开源项目直接对 PC 版 GTA IV 1.0.7.0 可执行文件做运行时 ASI 注入重写，现已实现 462 个函数、跨过 1% 里程碑，代码按 MIT 协议开源。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 23:00:59 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">002cd5ef16f3d8854b3bcc8c5ddea938d10320bb</guid><source url="https://dev.to/master4824/gta4-reversed-starting-a-c20-runtime-reimplementation-of-gta-iv-1070-crossing-1-e5">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>怎样写游戏提示词，才能让 AI 做出你想象中的游戏</title><link>https://dev.to/tyrboai/how-to-write-a-game-prompt-that-builds-the-game-you-imagine-3api</link><description>一份好的游戏提示词要说清玩家做什么、什么在阻挠、怎么才算赢、画面什么样，再加一个属于你自己的点子，文章用正反例子拆解了这五个部分。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 23:43:17 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">8b3b6899c93d043e2d1f16ad4841a533ebb0317c</guid><source url="https://dev.to/tyrboai/how-to-write-a-game-prompt-that-builds-the-game-you-imagine-3api">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>在 Unreal Engine 5 中打造实时沙漠神庙场景</title><link>https://80.lv/articles/creating-real-time-desert-temple-environment-in-unreal-engine-5</link><description>作者分享了如何把沙漠神庙的概念原画扩展成实时场景，在写实与风格化之间找到平衡。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 02:49:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">843fbf4e1540613e2a632bcd21d7a7d2ab616b10</guid><source url="https://80.lv/articles/creating-real-time-desert-temple-environment-in-unreal-engine-5">80 Level</source></item><item><title>用 HTML5 Canvas 与 WebSockets 架构 60FPS 实时多人火柴人对战竞技场：《Paper War》的工程实践</title><link>https://dev.to/uchitchakma/architecting-a-60fps-real-time-multiplayer-stickman-battle-arena-with-html5-canvas-websockets-4268</link><description>一篇实战复盘，讲如何在标准浏览器里用 Canvas 与 WebSocket 搭出 60FPS 的实时多人火柴人对战，并保证同步与手感。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 03:36:08 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">802b858ad9642d2ad909179122a21367161f9b0a</guid><source url="https://dev.to/uchitchakma/architecting-a-60fps-real-time-multiplayer-stickman-battle-arena-with-html5-canvas-websockets-4268">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item></channel></rss>
